{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/infernal-exalted/1553170-2e-fiends-and-sidereal-martial-arts","id":1553170,"title":"2e Fiends and Sidereal Martial Arts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Infernal Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-08-14T08:40:19-07:00","id":1553170,"title":"2e Fiends and Sidereal Martial Arts","content":"Greetings,<br /> <br /> My understanding is that Infernals can not learn Sidereal Martial Arts but (being charms) those could be learned by Fiends, whose Anima Power allows them learn charms of other types.<br /> <br /> Is this correct? Am I misunderstanding any of the ways the restriction or the Anima power works?<br /> <br /> Thanks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 08-14-2025, 06:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-08-14T14:52:24-07:00","id":1553186,"title":"","content":"Scroll of Errata, p, 90:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> See page 20 for the Eclipse Caste anima errata, which applies to the Fiend anima as well. No Green Sun Prince, even a Fiend, is capable of learning Sidereal martial arts. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-08-16T09:49:37-07:00","id":1553220,"title":"","content":"Thanks for your reply <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar522_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"522\" data-vbnamecard=\"522\">Stupid Loserman</a><br /> <br /> Regarding 2.5 Native keyword, I found the scroll of errata:<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Native: Powers like the Eclipse, Moonshadow and Fiend<br /> anima do not allow acquisition of Native Charms. Only natural<br /> wielders can learn Native charms. <b>Exalted Charms and hero-<br /> style expansions are natural to the appropriate type of Chosen.<br /> Spirit Charms are natural to gods, elementals, demons and<br /> akuma. Arcanoi are natural to ghosts. Raksha Charms are nat-<br /> ural to Fair Folk. Primordial Charms are natural to Primordi-<br /> als, Green Sun Princes and Exalted akuma.</b> The God-Blooded<br /> children of natural wielders cannot learn their parents\u2019 Native<br /> Charms. Martial Arts Charms that are not Hero Style expan-<br /> sions cannot have the Native keyword. </div> </div> </div>What can a Fiend learn if everything is native?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-08-17T05:09:29-07:00","id":1553226,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lbeaumanior</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/infernal-exalted/1553170-2e-fiends-and-sidereal-martial-arts?p=1553220#post1553220\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks for your reply <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar522_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"522\" data-vbnamecard=\"522\">Stupid Loserman</a><br /> <br /> Regarding 2.5 Native keyword, I found the scroll of errata:<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> What can a Fiend learn if everything is native?</div> </div> </div> </div>Not everything is Native; only the Charms with the specific Native Keyword are. &quot;Natural&quot; to something refers to the specific groups that can use a given type of Native Charm. The Charms that have the Native Keyword are things like Ox-Body and other basic effects that would break the system over a knee if you could stack multiple different types of them, and effects that are very in-theme for a given natural wielder to have and not share around.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-08-17T12:32:17-07:00","id":1553235,"title":"","content":"Thanks <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar23_3.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"23\" data-vbnamecard=\"23\">Saur Ops Specialist</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}